<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>로그인 - 종이나라</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;500;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body class="page-body">
    <!-- 헤더 -->
    <header class="page-header">
        <a href="/" class="logo-container">
            <div class="logo-mark">
                <div class="paper paper-1"></div>
                <div class="paper paper-2"></div>
                <div class="paper paper-3"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="logo-text">
                <span class="logo-main">종이나라</span>
                <span class="logo-sub">JONGIENARA</span>
            </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="back-home"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> 홈으로</a>
    </header>

    <main class="page-main">
        <div class="form-card">
            <div class="form-header">
                <div class="form-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
                </div>
                <h1>로그인</h1>
                <p>종이나라에 오신 것을 환영합니다</p>
            </div>

            <form class="form-body" method="POST" action="/login">
                <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-error">
                    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> <%= error %>
                </div>
                <% } %>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <label for="email">아이디 (이메일)</label>
                    <div class="input-wrap">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="이메일을 입력하세요" required>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="input-group">
                    <label for="password">비밀번호</label>
                    <div class="input-wrap">
                        <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
                        <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호를 입력하세요" required>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-options">
                    <label class="checkbox-wrap">
                        <input type="checkbox"> <span>로그인 유지</span>
                    </label>
                    <a href="#" class="forgot-link">비밀번호 찾기</a>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">로그인</button>

                <div class="form-divider">
                    <span>또는</span>
                </div>

                <div class="social-login">
                    <button type="button" class="btn-social btn-kakao">
                        <i class="fas fa-comment"></i> 카카오 로그인
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-social btn-naver">
                        <strong>N</strong> 네이버 로그인
                    </button>
                </div>

                <p class="form-footer-text">
                    아직 회원이 아니신가요? <a href="/register">회원가입</a>
                </p>
            </form>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>

</html>
